Error [E0029]: `x` has two capability markers
  --> tests/ui/two_capability_markers.jet:3:10
    |
  3 | fn bump(&x: &Int) {
    |          ^
 Why: the write-capability marker `&` before the parameter name conflicts with the write-capability marker `&` on its type; a parameter can declare only one capability
 Fix: keep one capability marker on the type or receiver and remove the other
